{"version":3,"kind":"Notebook","sha256":"f6bfe7c4a72ec02ff4ff2466d428d53bc0ce87fe5113b8844cbecef3b14029b8","slug":"lister-og-tabeller","location":"/matematikk/Lister-og-tabeller.ipynb","dependencies":[],"frontmatter":{"title":"Lister og tabeller i Python","content_includes_title":false,"kernelspec":{"name":"python3","display_name":"Python 3 (ipykernel)","language":"python"},"numbering":{"title":{"offset":1}},"exports":[{"format":"ipynb","filename":"Lister-og-tabeller.ipynb","url":"/Lister-og-tabeller-3f8d7e49a90f1b6d0cb37d236fdad7a7.ipynb"}]},"widgets":{},"mdast":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Denne siden skal flyttes til grunnleggende proammering for skolen, passer ikke her.","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"mylwEFMMli"}],"key":"itQl16gDo2"}],"identifier":"d47fadd5-14bb-456a-a79a-1eae0ab9c801","html_id":"d47fadd5-14bb-456a-a79a-1eae0ab9c801","key":"u9XKXtzVRO"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Arrayer og tabeller","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"vS1Wj3tHZm"}],"identifier":"arrayer-og-tabeller","label":"Arrayer og tabeller","html_id":"arrayer-og-tabeller","implicit":true,"key":"IQOPKKJoLg"}],"identifier":"f40cddee-98bf-4f33-a4b5-dffe55754031","html_id":"f40cddee-98bf-4f33-a4b5-dffe55754031","key":"YJurH4CXVY"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"I tillegg til de vanlige datatypene vi allerede har snakket om har Pyton også mulighet for å huske flere verdier en og samme variabeltype. Python har innebygget 3 forskjellige typer for dette, lister, tupler og dictionaries. Vi skal her kun se på den første typen: lister!","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"It3skt5TSq"}],"key":"UdzZUlhG5W"}],"identifier":"0adb82c2-3bd1-45b1-8313-c1b6578abf1b","html_id":"0adb82c2-3bd1-45b1-8313-c1b6578abf1b","key":"McJFdIYzMd"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"# Deklarasjon av liste uten innhold\ntomListe = []\n\n# liste med floats\nlisteDesimaltall = [3.2, 4.2, -8.0, 1.6]\n#liste med forskjellige datatyper\nlisteMix = [\"Ole\", 101, True, -4.89]\n\nprint(listeDesimaltall)\nprint(listeMix)","key":"nZOJ5UFnVP"},{"type":"outputs","id":"osCrlqh7V25VSq_6l7gtf","children":[{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"[3.2, 4.2, -8.0, 1.6]\n['Ole', 101, True, -4.89]\n"},"children":[],"key":"lDq5GSqEx1"}],"key":"JERUznQzam"}],"identifier":"c155bbf0-84a6-4108-95fd-92ada30793e2","html_id":"c155bbf0-84a6-4108-95fd-92ada30793e2","key":"DTI0RWuQRE"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Som dere ser av eksemplet kan en liste bestå av ingen, en eller flere elementer. Siden Python ikke er kresent på datatyper så kan en liste bestå av hvilken som helst av disse og til og med forskjellige datatyper i samme liste. Dette er ikke vanlig i andre programmeringsspråk. For å skrive ut ett element fra listen brukes skrivemåten minListe[posisjon]. Legg merke til at referansen til første element starter på 0 og ikke 1. Prøv å legge til disse to linjene nederst i programmet:","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"gyLs7arxKE"}],"key":"buhT6DTS93"}],"identifier":"dfd11510-11bc-4f82-bbca-e4ee891848ab","html_id":"dfd11510-11bc-4f82-bbca-e4ee891848ab","key":"ey1fKc7ScY"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","value":"print(listeDesimaltall[1])\nprint(listeMix[0])","key":"XChQ9dDUp1"}],"identifier":"4d3b3de4-c0ea-47b9-be9e-2ff19fbd443b","html_id":"4d3b3de4-c0ea-47b9-be9e-2ff19fbd443b","key":"BmhlPFXit4"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"admonition","kind":"tip","children":[{"type":"admonitionTitle","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Oppgave","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"ilZL4Ieq4j"}],"key":"UhRQ2pEVon"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Prøv å endre tallet for listeposisjonen (index) i de to print-kommandoene og se om du får skrevet ut det du tror.","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"YXZe1GSgoc"}],"key":"tLl7QgeXPq"}],"key":"r29TF9Xj1U"}],"identifier":"fd1961a4-fab4-4b38-b334-435820fb7b72","html_id":"fd1961a4-fab4-4b38-b334-435820fb7b72","key":"e5ZK49wURR"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Det finnes mange funksjoner som hører til datatypen lister, og vi skal ikke gå igjennom alle sammen her. Men som eksempler på nyttige funksjoner skal vi se på hvordan man kan legge til og fjerne elementer, samt sortere lister. Se eksempelet under:","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"fAdjS1rK5V"}],"key":"QMght8zV6n"}],"identifier":"e1af5434-b768-47a2-a26a-ad8e6f140656","html_id":"e1af5434-b768-47a2-a26a-ad8e6f140656","key":"KrlKOSgFYv"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"minListe = [\"Ole\", \"Thomas\", \"Kari\", \"Ali\", \"Miriam\", \"Martine\", \"Jonas\", \"Vilde\"]\nprint(minListe)\n\n# Legger til element på slutten av listen\nminListe.append(\"Hermann\")\nprint(minListe)\n\n# Fjerner et objekt fra listen\nminListe.remove(\"Kari\")\nprint(minListe)\n\n# Fjerner element fra listen basert på ideks, og sparer i en variabel (popping)\nnavn = minListe.pop(1)\nprint(navn)\nprint(minListe)\n\n# Sorterer listen alfabetisk\nminListe.sort()\nprint(minListe)","key":"d4awCsRzfZ"},{"type":"outputs","id":"5pZL1RJdWdh7iFVNOLjkd","children":[{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"['Ole', 'Thomas', 'Kari', 'Ali', 'Miriam', 'Martine', 'Jonas', 'Vilde']\n['Ole', 'Thomas', 'Kari', 'Ali', 'Miriam', 'Martine', 'Jonas', 'Vilde', 'Hermann']\n['Ole', 'Thomas', 'Ali', 'Miriam', 'Martine', 'Jonas', 'Vilde', 'Hermann']\nThomas\n['Ole', 'Ali', 'Miriam', 'Martine', 'Jonas', 'Vilde', 'Hermann']\n['Ali', 'Hermann', 'Jonas', 'Martine', 'Miriam', 'Ole', 'Vilde']\n"},"children":[],"key":"uhS8BrCrJ2"}],"key":"uoQd6dVYjM"}],"identifier":"aba41399-de7d-4eff-9a39-2fbd6e435f26","html_id":"aba41399-de7d-4eff-9a39-2fbd6e435f26","key":"Fi9Imb2gJN"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"list","ordered":false,"spread":false,"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Append legger til et element på slutten av listen.","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"fRm1Ytebs5"}],"key":"EfYOTDqwK1"}],"key":"J4pQJJ3VYj"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Remove trekker fra bestemte objekter i lista. Hvis flere elementer er likeså fjernes alle.","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"WtzkB7AwBm"}],"key":"j6ixJ0anbE"}],"key":"NVkIhLtgN6"},{"type":"listItem","spread":true,"position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Pop henter ut et element fra listen og returnerer elementet slik at det kan for eksempel skrives ut eller legges i en annen variabel. Dersom pop kalles uten indeks (for eksempel: minListe.pop() ), vil den hente ut det siste elementet i listen.","position":{"start":{"line":3,"column":1},"end":{"line":3,"column":1}},"key":"eoVckiPfJ7"}],"key":"ZSvcInQReM"}],"key":"pBlvWS4mNM"}],"key":"yvZUQeL5Rx"}],"identifier":"cd1dee07-2837-4007-ae5f-700825df0b7b","html_id":"cd1dee07-2837-4007-ae5f-700825df0b7b","key":"IXhy4LWrmY"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"admonition","kind":"tip","children":[{"type":"admonitionTitle","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Oppgave","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"AQKjSRMNmx"}],"key":"C7uQhtdK9e"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Eksperimenter med koden over. Prøv å legge til, fjerne eller poppe ting i listen. Bruk gjerne variabelinspektøren i Spyder for å observere i tillegg til det som skrives ut til skjerm!","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"ELFzDaPttE"}],"key":"XOq4aJHpj4"}],"key":"T2wATshkea"}],"identifier":"9d318707-7f08-4167-9aa9-147c6c159237","html_id":"9d318707-7f08-4167-9aa9-147c6c159237","key":"KoFddAxzFR"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Iterasjon av lister","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"udRSu6r7NK"}],"identifier":"iterasjon-av-lister","label":"Iterasjon av lister","html_id":"iterasjon-av-lister","implicit":true,"key":"WRY5PPakRW"}],"identifier":"f3dfda21-c216-49d3-9620-945e4869bb2c","html_id":"f3dfda21-c216-49d3-9620-945e4869bb2c","key":"zOueXEBm4s"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Å iterere en liste betyr å «bla igjennom lista», gjerne i en for-sløyfe. I mange kodespråk gjøres dette på den første måten som vist i eksempelet over ved at man lager en teller (index) som teller fra 0 og til antall elementer i listen, og henter ut elementene ved hjelp av denne indeksen.","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"UxWR96lsS4"}],"key":"UEfYgxXxDk"}],"identifier":"5bfe83df-76da-4ea4-b7f4-3398dc64b1b0","html_id":"5bfe83df-76da-4ea4-b7f4-3398dc64b1b0","key":"uDvHznrfbL"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"En mer snedig måte å gjøre dette på er vist i den nederste metoden: Her skjønner pyton at den skal gå igjennom listen, men i stedet for å bruke en tallindeks, henter python automatisk hvert element in i sløyfevariablen direkte.","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"MTHKu3C8yI"}],"key":"Ys2yD759RM"}],"identifier":"de77dd41-a1a6-45bf-ac49-36cee595c325","html_id":"de77dd41-a1a6-45bf-ac49-36cee595c325","key":"KLoDuPUbt2"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"minListe = [\"Ole\", \"Thomas\", \"Kari\", \"Ali\", \"Miriam\", \"Martine\", \"Jonas\", \"Vilde\"]\n\n# Iterasjon med index, len() gir lengden på lista\nfor index in range(len(minListe)):\n    print(minListe[index])\n\n# for mellomrom i utskrift\nprint(\"\")\n\n# Iterasjon med elementmetode (snedig)\nfor element in minListe:\n    print(element)\n","key":"ylTxyMkyhe"},{"type":"outputs","id":"J9Afxhx_f8AjjzW077rN3","children":[{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"Ole\nThomas\nKari\nAli\nMiriam\nMartine\nJonas\nVilde\n\nOle\nThomas\nKari\nAli\nMiriam\nMartine\nJonas\nVilde\n"},"children":[],"key":"ESchQc7rdf"}],"key":"XALClltpmH"}],"identifier":"ac10c172-2506-485d-8036-8d221fcceeb0","html_id":"ac10c172-2506-485d-8036-8d221fcceeb0","key":"MASsWrSg4s"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"admonition","kind":"tip","children":[{"type":"admonitionTitle","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Oppgave","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"QF0zr17z0x"}],"key":"HhTRUDs9ld"},{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"I eksempelet over vil koden \"len(minListe) returnere antallet elementer i listen (i dette tilfellet 8). Prøv å legge til to ekstra navn i listen og kjør på nytt. Legg til en linje nederst “print(len(minListe)”. Sjekk at “len(minListe)” alltid gir dere riktig antall elementer når dere endrer listen!","position":{"start":{"line":2,"column":1},"end":{"line":2,"column":1}},"key":"bxvEVn28p3"}],"key":"QMDtN7f2YG"}],"key":"RbndbTxFWp"}],"identifier":"d6291f41-db78-4a7c-8c37-ffac319cc985","html_id":"d6291f41-db78-4a7c-8c37-ffac319cc985","key":"CEESWyjYvq"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","data":{"tags":[]},"children":[{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Iterasjon av Arrays","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"MxU4LSclyH"}],"identifier":"iterasjon-av-arrays","label":"Iterasjon av Arrays","html_id":"iterasjon-av-arrays","implicit":true,"key":"na1HjywPPF"}],"identifier":"27c692ad-9e50-41ed-9e2d-9e56e273e8d3","html_id":"27c692ad-9e50-41ed-9e2d-9e56e273e8d3","visibility":"show","key":"rKAFRhSgZ7"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Iterasjon av arrays er helt likt som for lister. Følgende eksempel itererer et array som heter x, og regner riemannsummen under funksjonsverdien. Verdien til elementene hentes ut med x[i], der i er elementnummeret som telles opp i for-sløyfa:","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"AZPoiIEgZ2"}],"key":"lgXBVkxFWz"}],"identifier":"6a35ca76-475d-4d83-ad17-0a26febcdde5","html_id":"6a35ca76-475d-4d83-ad17-0a26febcdde5","key":"m2CqU5fRaC"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"import numpy as np\n\nminArray = np.linspace(-3, 3, 7)\nfor i in range(minArray.size):\n    print(minArray[i])","key":"q3EaqfAkLL"},{"type":"outputs","id":"_mkFRxIUgnsXqqG57K7T6","children":[{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"-3.0\n-2.0\n-1.0\n0.0\n1.0\n2.0\n3.0\n"},"children":[],"key":"Sf17q4WxFm"}],"key":"pYDe6Wva0G"}],"identifier":"82aba4bc-e7bb-4ee0-9092-23c10fa5cc09","html_id":"82aba4bc-e7bb-4ee0-9092-23c10fa5cc09","key":"hwKwL0Hn5F"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Det går også an å bruke «elementmetoden» på arrays.","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"D2irBYryR5"}],"key":"n8b4kq1WTN"}],"identifier":"b5b7246e-d239-4512-9751-48e11c6926bc","html_id":"b5b7246e-d239-4512-9751-48e11c6926bc","key":"QM1aewi5Ap"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","data":{"scrolled":true},"children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"import numpy as np\n\nminArray = np.linspace(-3, 3, 7)\nfor element in minArray:\n    print(element)","key":"SI0NGPBaQx"},{"type":"outputs","id":"jap0L8xy3DLRigRszzbaY","children":[{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"-3.0\n-2.0\n-1.0\n0.0\n1.0\n2.0\n3.0\n"},"children":[],"key":"JI4hSaMVat"}],"key":"eAwafv5lr3"}],"identifier":"1b3ebe74-b44a-44aa-87c5-7fd66092d7d5","html_id":"1b3ebe74-b44a-44aa-87c5-7fd66092d7d5","key":"rlsqkduYp6"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":2,"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Biblioteker","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"mrbOOLiw61"}],"identifier":"biblioteker","label":"Biblioteker","html_id":"biblioteker","implicit":true,"key":"rkMSTSTAjP"}],"identifier":"a78129ab-764b-486c-8d2b-1e5a4868104e","html_id":"a78129ab-764b-486c-8d2b-1e5a4868104e","key":"meRj0IA3pg"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Python er et programmeringsspråk under utvikling, selv om struktur og basiskommandoer er uendret kan det hende at det kommer nye konvensjoner på hvordan ting skal gjøres. Derfor kan det hende at man i noen kodeeksempler ser at ting blir gjort på én måte, mens i andre eksempler en annen. I skrivende stund er Python i versjon 3, som kom i 2008. Likevel er det vanlig å finne eksempler som er skrevet i versjon 2.7. Disse eksemplene kjører fint i Python 3, men det hender at du vil få en advarsel under kjøring.","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"TOriWVEFDy"}],"key":"r4wthGLWZz"}],"identifier":"e10e5e7d-4f40-4633-8f1f-fdfd172023e4","html_id":"e10e5e7d-4f40-4633-8f1f-fdfd172023e4","key":"vmYopRVuxb"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"“Star imports”","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"wpCF3QsQ6m"}],"identifier":"star-imports","label":"“Star imports”","html_id":"star-imports","implicit":true,"key":"ZDK7vZLqC2"}],"identifier":"11aaaaa9-4ac5-4c30-911c-75eb3b8dda05","html_id":"11aaaaa9-4ac5-4c30-911c-75eb3b8dda05","key":"yVOElJUAY7"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Det er spesielt en ting man skal legge merke til. Når det gjelder importering av biblioteker vil man nå, i de fleste utviklingsmiljøer (f. eks Spyder) få advarsel hvis man prøver å importere hele biblioteker uten å gi de et lokalt navn. Se eksempelet under:","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"D2nD5aYlKT"}],"key":"lYI8ReTxmF"}],"identifier":"1ae6460d-11af-4bc0-af29-7489ba35ceb7","html_id":"1ae6460d-11af-4bc0-af29-7489ba35ceb7","key":"TVIIBg9Cd3"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"from math import *\nfrom numpy import *\n\nsvar = sin(2*pi)\nprint(svar)","key":"ZJDfWytpiN"},{"type":"outputs","id":"A05WZFBvudyqCOni1QQj7","children":[{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"-2.4492935982947064e-16\n"},"children":[],"key":"ZDsxBt5nB2"}],"key":"Pacme3jK4a"}],"identifier":"b95921f4-44ad-48cc-b7f0-32f950e7c381","html_id":"b95921f4-44ad-48cc-b7f0-32f950e7c381","key":"mku5a1iGk0"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Her er bibliotekene math og numpy importert på den gamle måten med alle sine respektive funksjoner. Det betyr at hvis disse bibliotekene inneholder en funksjon eller en konstant med samme navn, så vet ikke Python hvilken som skal kjøres. Og begge disse matematikkbibliotekene inneholder hver sin utgave av funksjonen sin() og pi. I den 3. instruksen her, svar = sin(2*pi), velger sannsynligvis Python fra det biblioteket som ble importert først. Akkurat her har det ikke noe å si for resultatet, men det er ikke alltid sikkert.","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"AmFYdwLmN9"}],"key":"NkaeoThjV5"}],"identifier":"77ae2c6d-036f-468c-ac94-dff1aad89446","html_id":"77ae2c6d-036f-468c-ac94-dff1aad89446","key":"mSN0ZuD2Ux"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Import-metoden","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"mFP3ROTtQh"}],"identifier":"import-metoden","label":"Import-metoden","html_id":"import-metoden","implicit":true,"key":"Sp2llw51a4"}],"identifier":"11eadda6-407b-449d-b538-f72a4910bcd9","html_id":"11eadda6-407b-449d-b538-f72a4910bcd9","key":"RiTQbr0Md6"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"En mye bedre måte å importere biblioteker på er å bruke denne metoden:","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"MbUoG3mdrt"}],"key":"wZDUDD6L10"}],"identifier":"c53ce563-121d-4ec9-8e0e-22edf4a8aa95","html_id":"c53ce563-121d-4ec9-8e0e-22edf4a8aa95","key":"oz3BBUTRQ7"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"import math\nimport numpy\n\nsvar = math.sin(2*numpy.pi)\nprint(svar)","key":"dCyEvpZKxY"},{"type":"outputs","id":"Eofy8_NvYL1tCviqeHdxd","children":[{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"-2.4492935982947064e-16\n"},"children":[],"key":"v2Rfopf4yJ"}],"key":"MewC5tsXwz"}],"identifier":"7fec271b-399e-4cb0-9f1a-b89a66b1d59f","html_id":"7fec271b-399e-4cb0-9f1a-b89a66b1d59f","key":"j9GvOx3Yvw"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Her blir bibliotekenes funksjoner importer under sitt eget navn. Når man da skal kalle funksjoner eller bruke konstanter fra bibliotekene så angir man dette med biblioteksnavnet som prefiks slik: biblioteksnavn.funksjonsnavn() eller konstantnavn. På denne måten kan vi importere biblioteker som inneholder funksjoner med samme navn uten at det blir problemer av det. I eksempelet over brukes sinusfunksjonen fra math, og konstanten pi fra numpy","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"kuoL4PPhoT"}],"key":"qLeqtNVmyv"}],"identifier":"d2d28176-294d-4b43-a7e2-32922dbc5388","html_id":"d2d28176-294d-4b43-a7e2-32922dbc5388","key":"BX9MESTYzk"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Alias-metoden","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"VbNSJ3hCNs"}],"identifier":"alias-metoden","label":"Alias-metoden","html_id":"alias-metoden","implicit":true,"key":"HiD2FWLWz7"}],"identifier":"27c5c7e6-db74-4b53-ba76-54219900bba7","html_id":"27c5c7e6-db74-4b53-ba76-54219900bba7","key":"ozk8F6Sb5m"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Man kan også importere biblioteker og gi de et lokalt alias. Denne metoden er ofte brukt for å lage forkortelser, eller hvis man skal importere et underbibliotek","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"bun1l98w6o"}],"key":"gaNbuGPUvE"}],"identifier":"00477d0e-10fe-4f03-90fa-d8b8fcd3ac2c","html_id":"00477d0e-10fe-4f03-90fa-d8b8fcd3ac2c","key":"BUkcKna05k"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"import math as m\nimport numpy as np\n\nsvar = np.sin(2*m.pi)\nprint(svar)","key":"ta368X1vgD"},{"type":"outputs","id":"rzxZb-t7bLCKJ-DFs2Ofs","children":[{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"name":"stdout","output_type":"stream","text":"-2.4492935982947064e-16\n"},"children":[],"key":"ok8mHE21bc"}],"key":"PhJ5mOVkFv"}],"identifier":"576d9a3f-6024-488b-a21b-77d57d797bcc","html_id":"576d9a3f-6024-488b-a21b-77d57d797bcc","key":"XrcuCPPNCA"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Her er bibliotekene math og numpy importert slik at de får de lokale aliasene m og np. Man kan selv velge hvilket alias som skal brukes lokalt, men det er lurt å velge et navn slik at man husker hva det refererer til. Hvis man vil bruke sin() fra numpy, så skriver man np.sin(). I eksempelet over henter vi sin() fra numpy og konstanten pi fra math. (Motsatt av forrige eksempel!)","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"fEI7b8GRJM"}],"key":"EqpHudOztO"}],"identifier":"3ffa8661-4c7b-4291-85bc-3b434c7451f4","html_id":"3ffa8661-4c7b-4291-85bc-3b434c7451f4","key":"oauHtlJvdj"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"heading","depth":3,"position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Importere del av et bibliotek","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"mbdaeCCn3v"}],"identifier":"importere-del-av-et-bibliotek","label":"Importere del av et bibliotek","html_id":"importere-del-av-et-bibliotek","implicit":true,"key":"HUGcGZSoHu"}],"identifier":"4825f0ab-a2e9-4721-817c-da12c5546878","html_id":"4825f0ab-a2e9-4721-817c-da12c5546878","key":"QcndF0KRGU"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Noen ganger vil man ikke importere hele biblioteker, da kan man importere bare den biten man ønsker seg. I eksempelet under vil vi importere en plottefunksjon fra mathplotlib, som er et ganske omfattende bibliotek.","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"r2M3mmcKYs"}],"key":"CVPvjRU1FK"}],"identifier":"d52e3815-2df6-4e35-bade-fc31d377e661","html_id":"d52e3815-2df6-4e35-bade-fc31d377e661","key":"p6PKWxbSIz"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-code","children":[{"type":"code","lang":"python","executable":true,"value":"import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\nimport numpy as np\n\nx = np.linspace(-4,4,100)\ny = x**2-4\n\nplt.plot(x,y)\nplt.show()","key":"H5uTSTvgDj"},{"type":"outputs","id":"iDUNrSS6p7L0p4RHALzXc","children":[{"type":"output","jupyter_data":{"output_type":"display_data","metadata":{},"data":{"image/png":{"content_type":"image/png","hash":"858e1b235e3339f77697e171008388d4","path":"/858e1b235e3339f77697e171008388d4.png"},"text/plain":{"content":"<Figure size 640x480 with 1 Axes>","content_type":"text/plain"}}},"children":[],"key":"mwzcv6MV1e"}],"key":"ug2yeR35y0"}],"identifier":"59dada38-d0d9-4d8e-8ac4-e916844dcc82","html_id":"59dada38-d0d9-4d8e-8ac4-e916844dcc82","key":"NSOyZExNOG"},{"type":"block","kind":"notebook-content","children":[{"type":"paragraph","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"Koden over importerer kun underbiblioteket pyplot og vi gir det det lokale aliaset plt, som nå refererer direkte til dette.","position":{"start":{"line":1,"column":1},"end":{"line":1,"column":1}},"key":"DNW34kY87M"}],"key":"jyuWOUxvmW"}],"identifier":"ff1e1360-5612-4aa4-b85b-86a772efa747","html_id":"ff1e1360-5612-4aa4-b85b-86a772efa747","key":"J2EmfsAW3B"}],"key":"FobAhNO601"},"references":{"cite":{"order":[],"data":{}}}}